  "info": {
    "lines": [
      "<p>This song is just like <a href=\"?song=theory/mode-nat-minor-transposed.json\">theory/mode-nat-minor-transposed.json</a> except that it uses theme \"Guitar\" which has an Ebony/Ivory cell scheme so you can see the piano key diatonics in C.</p>",
      "",
      "<p>This is helpful because the natural minor mode used is the relative minor of C when the key is E♭, so you can easily see that it is the same pattern as diatonic C.  Then as the key transposes to other keys, you can see this pattern moving, and learn which keys use the black keys in which positions.</p>"
    ]
  },
